\title{Design-Aware Scientific Modeling Workflows}
\description{A scientific orchestration framework for explicit design declarations, leakage safeguards, reproducible validation, supervised and probabilistic modeling, tuning, benchmarking, diagnostics, and provenance.}
\details{Version 1.0.0 is the Consolidated Scientific Release source tree. It preserves the 0.9.0 frozen public API, complete Gold/reference suite, protected external validation, publication reporting, typed uncertainty, safe persistence, deployment/scalability contracts, and cross-language validation fixtures. Runtime, numerical, optional-backend, rendered-documentation, and CRAN-style certification are reported explicitly and remain pending until actually executed in supported local environments.}
\author{Walter Esfrain Pereira and Magali Haidee Pereira Martinez}
